                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Again, it\u2019s 3:30AM\u2014and we\u2019re STILL on the House floor fighting this Big Ugly Bill.\n\nWhy do Republicans insist on pushing this trash while the American people sleep?\n\nBecause they know the truth is ugly:\n\n\u2014 17 million Americans kicked off Medicaid\n\u2014 Children, veterans, working families, and people with disabilities left behind\n\u2014 Cuts to SNAP, housing, education, and disaster relief\n\u2014 Tax breaks for billionaires while everyday folks get crumbs\n\nLet me be crystal clear:\nI will VOTE NO.\n\nThis is cowardly, cruel, and calculated.\nBut we\u2019re wide awake\u2014and we won\u2019t let them win.\n\n#WeWontLetThem\n#ProtectMedicaid\n#PeopleOverPolitics\n#BigUglyBill\n#NotInMyName",
